<view class="page-treehole-publish app-page app-page--padded"><top-bar title="写一段树洞" back="true"></top-bar><view class="page-treehole-publish__description">内容会以匿名身份展示，并经过固定规则检查。检查中的内容不会出现在公开列表。</view><textarea class="page-treehole-publish__textarea" maxlength="1000" value="{{body}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="写下此刻想说的话"></textarea><view class="page-treehole-publish__muted page-treehole-publish__text-count">{{body.length}} / 1000</view><view wx:if="{{checked}}" class="page-treehole-publish__surface page-treehole-publish__check-panel"><view class="page-treehole-publish__section-title page-treehole-publish__section-title--first">检查提示</view><view class="page-treehole-publish__muted">内容已通过基础格式检查，提交后可能会进入检查中或保护展示状态。你可以确认后提交。</view></view><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="还不能提交" message="{{error}}"></state-message><primary-button wx:if="{{!checked}}" label="继续检查" bindaction="check"></primary-button><primary-button wx:else label="确认提交" loading="{{loading}}" bindaction="submit"></primary-button></view>
